OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSome cloud to start, with
OL,6,Fperhaps an isolated shower. Soon
OL,7,Fbrightening up with spells of hazy
OL,8,Fsunshine, though still the chance of a
OL,9,Ffew showers in the north. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasant.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,13,Fcloudy Monday, with rain likely
OL,14,Fovernight. This clearing to sunny
OL,15,Fspells Tuesday and Wednesday, with the
OL,16,Fchance of a few showers. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnearer average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
